// multiply.lmc - a * b by repeated addition
// Input: 6, 7      Output: 42
        INP
        STA a
        INP
        STA count
loop    LDA count
        BRZ done
        SUB one
        STA count
        LDA total
        ADD a
        STA total
        BRA loop
done    LDA total
        OUT
        HLT
a       DAT
count   DAT
total   DAT 0
one     DAT 1
